        "claims": [
          {
            "content": "At main flow step 1, if the Non-C2 JU attempts to transmit on the Surveillance NPG, this violates the requirement that Non-C2 JUs shall not transmit on the Surveillance NPG.",
            "evidence_refs": [
              "EC-EF-000"
            ],
            "step_number": 1
          },
          {
            "content": "At main flow step 3, if EW product information is no longer valid or time-related update requirements are not met, transmission of that EW product information is terminated, ending the exception branch for that EW product information.",
            "evidence_refs": [
              "EC-EF-012"
            ],
            "step_number": 3
          },
          {
            "content": "At main flow step 3, if no J7.0 (ACT = 0) message is received and no further updates are received for a remote track, the system automatically purges those remote tracks (DRT = 0-3) after a specific time interval; the purged tracks are removed from the received track data, ending the exception branch for those tracks.",
            "evidence_refs": [
              "EC-EF-021"
            ],
            "step_number": 3
          },
          {
            "content": "At main flow step 3, if no further updates are received for DATUMS (DRT = 4), they shall not be purged automatically; the DATUM remains in the received data, ending the exception branch with the DATUM retained.",
            "evidence_refs": [
              "EC-EF-023"
            ],
            "step_number": 3
          },
          {
            "content": "At main flow step 3, if no further updates or J7.0 Drop Track Report messages are received for a remote ballistic missile track, the system should have the capability to automatically purge that track after a system-selected time interval.",
            "evidence_refs": [
              "EC-EF-024"
            ],
            "step_number": 3
          },
          {
            "content": "At main flow step 3, if a specified time interval has elapsed since a remote track's/point's last report, a JU may have the capability to automatically drop that remote track/point.",
            "evidence_refs": [
              "EC-EF-018"
            ],
            "step_number": 3
          }
        ],
